## Final project: Учебная платформа

The learning platform is being introduced in focused review branches, starting
with the database, migrations, health probes, and API v1 application foundation.
Assignments remain on `ASSIGNMENT-4` and `ASSIGNMENT-6`.

See the [quickstart](docs/quickstart.md) for local setup and the
[API guide](docs/platform.md) for the features available in this branch.

```bash
just bootstrap
just check
uv run --package app python -m app init-db
uv run --package app uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

Business routers live in `services/app/src/app/routers/v1/`. Tests mirror
`src/app/`, with a directory per handler and shared fixtures in `conftest.py`.
The existing uv, Just, Ruff, pytest, coverage, Allure, Hypothesis, and Schemathesis
tooling is retained. Run `just codegen` after editing this README's template.
See [development tools](docs/tools.md), [CI reports](docs/ci-reports.md), and
[local infrastructure](infra/README.md) for the workspace workflow.
